[ti:Lot 001 Tanpura Snap]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Sufi & Qawwali]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]Ank se jab hui shuruaat..
[00:16.17]kisne aisa suchaa thaa..
[00:24.35]aksharon ka bik jaanaa..
[00:32.52]ye sabse badaa dhokaa thaa..
[00:40.69]Dhaatu jab tak dhwani adhaarita...
[00:48.87]manavtaa hui kitni mahaan..
[00:57.04]sanJnaa ke jaalon mein phans gaye..
[01:05.21]sabko bandhe ek hi naam..
[01:13.39]Lagaa baazaar jane kyaa kyaa bikega aaj..
[01:21.56]aray is bikaawali main jaane kitne chhupe hain raaj..
[01:29.73]Bik raha hai 'Brahmi' ka woh pehla sanskaar,
[01:37.91]QR code mein simat gaya hai sadiyon ka vichaar.
[02:18.77]Sarvnaam jab raas naa aaye.. raja bhi rank ho jaaye..
[02:26.95]shabda na koi kaam aaye.. swatantrata ke bhram humne phasaaye..
[02:35.12]Vaakya mook bas paisa royen.. jane kon ab paar lagaye..
[02:43.29]Mantra tabhi ek kaam men aaye..
[02:51.47]rupya aadam ki sirf jaroorat..
[02:59.64]jane kyon itna sabko bhaaye..
[03:07.81]Aray is bikaawali mein..
[03:15.99]Kitne chhupe hain raaj!
